WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.248
Zippy did not like dirt paths.

2
00:00:15.249 --> 00:00:23.029
He did not like rocks.

3
00:00:23.030 --> 00:00:26.334
"This stinks," said Zippy.

4
00:00:26.335 --> 00:00:29.428
"I have to drive slowly.

5
00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:34.334
And these rocks hurt!"

6
00:00:34.335 --> 00:00:37.172
Eddy grinned.

7
00:00:37.173 --> 00:00:42.736
Now he was faster than Zippy!

8
00:00:42.737 --> 00:00:49.292
"I see mud!" cried Poppy.

9
00:00:49.293 --> 00:01:04.965
Everybody drove through the mud.

10
00:01:04.966 --> 00:01:08.139
"Oh no!" said Zippy.

11
00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:12.588
"My tires are muddy!"

12
00:01:12.589 --> 00:01:16.006
Eddy went fast in the mud.

13
00:01:16.007 --> 00:01:18.375
The mud splashed.

14
00:01:18.376 --> 00:01:25.563
Splat! Mud sprayed all over Zippy.

15
00:01:25.564 --> 00:01:29.170
"Hey!" cried Zippy.

16
00:01:29.171 --> 00:01:32.421
Poppy splashed in the mud.

17
00:01:32.422 --> 00:01:39.124
Splat! "Ugh!" cried Zippy.

18
00:01:39.125 --> 00:01:43.406
Jeb and Dipper splashed in the mud.

19
00:01:43.407 --> 00:01:51.602
Splat! Splat!

20
00:01:51.603 --> 00:01:55.194
Zippy spun his tires.

21
00:01:55.195 --> 00:01:57.971
But the mud was deep.

22
00:01:57.972 --> 00:02:03.896
His tires went deeper.

23
00:02:03.897 --> 00:02:08.380
"Oh no!" cried Zippy.

24
00:02:08.381 --> 00:02:13.617
"I'm stuck in the mud!"

